  "description": "Yalla!! V2 Frame Kit\nThe RAAW Yalla!! V2 is our answer to riders who want it all: proven performance, more versatility, and that unmistakable Yalla! feeling. Born on the legendary slopes of Champéry and refined through countless laps on race tracks and bike parks alike, the V2 builds on everything we loved about the original—just better. We kept the trusted geometry and suspension kinematics but added new features like adjustable, UDH-compatible dropouts and the option to run 29” or MX setups. Whether you’re chasing podiums or weekend thrills, the Yalla! V2 is built to go fast, take hits, and keep going—again and again.",
